## Match Events

### Object Types

| ID | Name | Description |
|----|------|-------------|
| worldcup_en_goals | Goals | One match goal. team_id identifies the credited team; player_team_id identifies the scorer’s team. Own goals do not count toward personal scoring totals. Shootout kicks are recorded separately. |
| worldcup_en_penalty_kicks | Shootout Kicks | One kick in a penalty shootout. converted=1 indicates a successful kick. Match penalties are identified by goals.penalty. |
| worldcup_en_substitutions | Substitutions | One player entering or leaving a match. A substitution can produce two rows; do not count paired rows as two substitution events. |
| worldcup_en_bookings | Bookings | Individual booking events. Distinguish straight red cards, second yellows and sending off. |
